            "text": "People change them with computers."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "No one looks like that!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "How you look does not matter."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "How you feel does."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Think about the things that can make you feel good."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "Then do more of those things!"
          }
        ]
      }
